---
// System / Pricing - Luxury Minimalist Dark Style
---

<section class="system section" id="system">
  <!-- Minimalist background letter -->
  <div class="system__bg-text text-outline-thin">S</div>

  <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <div class="system__header fade-up">
      <span class="section-label">05 / PRICE</span>
      <h2 class="section-title--jp">料金システム</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        あなたのライフスタイルに合わせたプラン。
      </p>
      
      <!-- Special Campaign -->
      <div class="system__campaign">
        <span class="campaign-badge">入会金 無料</span>
        <span class="campaign-text">年一括払いで<strong style="color:#FFF;">15%OFF</strong> ｜ 家族との同時入会で<strong style="color:#FFF;">10%OFF</strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="system__grid">
      <!-- Full Time (Men) -->
      <div class="system__card card fade-up">
        <div class="system__card-content">
          <h3 class="system__plan-name">フルタイム会員<span class="system__plan-sub">一般男性</span></h3>
          <div class="system__price">
            <span class="system__price-value">¥9,800</span>
            <span class="system__price-unit">/月 (税込)</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="system__features">
            <li>通い放題（全クラス参加可能）</li>
            <li>スパーリング・フリースパー参加可</li>
            <li>すべての設備が使い放題</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Full Time (Women / Students) -->
      <div class="system__card card fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="system__card-content">
          <h3 class="system__plan-name">フルタイム会員<span class="system__plan-sub">女性・中高生</span></h3>
          <div class="system__price">
            <span class="system__price-value" style="color:#FF5E1A;">¥7,800</span>
            <span class="system__price-unit">/月 (税込)</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="system__features">
            <li>通い放題（全クラス参加可能）</li>
            <li>女性や学生も安心して通える環境</li>
            <li>すべての設備が使い放題</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kids -->
      <div class="system__card card fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="system__card-content">
          <h3 class="system__plan-name">キッズ会員<span class="system__plan-sub">小学1〜6年生</span></h3>
          <div class="system__price">
            <span class="system__price-value">¥5,000</span>
            <span class="system__price-unit">/月 (税込)</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="system__features">
            <li>キッズクラス参加可能</li>
            <li>礼儀作法や基礎体力の向上</li>
            <li>楽しく安全に柔術を学べます</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Visitor Plan -->
    <div class="system__visitor fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
      <h3 class="system__plan-name">ビジター <span class="system__plan-sub" style="margin-left: 12px; border-left: 1px solid #555; padding-left: 12px;">1回利用</span></h3>
      <div class="system__price" style="margin-bottom: 0; border: none; padding: 0;">
        <span class="system__price-value">¥2,200</span>
        <span class="system__price-unit">/回 (税込)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="system__actions fade-up" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 80px;">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--white" style="min-width: 240px;">体験・入会お申し込み</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .system {
    padding: 180px 0;
    background: #000;
    color: #FFF;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .system__bg-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20%; left: -10%;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 80vw;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .system__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .system__campaign {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }

  .campaign-badge {
    background: #FF5E1A;
    color: #FFF;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .campaign-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #AAA;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .system__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0; /* Flush grid for elegant table-like layout */
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }

  .system__card {
    background: transparent;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    transition: background 0.4s ease;
  }

  .system__card:last-child {
    border-right: none;
  }

  .system__card:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }

  .system__card-content {
    padding: 60px 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .system__plan-name {
    font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #FFF;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .system__plan-sub {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #888;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .system__price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    padding-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .system__price-value {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #FFF;
  }

  .system__price-unit {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  .system__features {
    list-style: none;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .system__features li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #AAAAAA;
    padding: 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .system__features li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 16px;
    width: 6px; height: 1px;
    background: #FF5E1A;
  }

  /* Visitor Plan */
  .system__visitor {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    border-top: none; /* Connects smoothly to the grid above */
    padding: 32px 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .system__visitor .system__plan-name {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .system__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      border-right: none; border-bottom: none;
    }
    .system__card {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
    .system__visitor {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .system__visitor .system__plan-name {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .system__visitor .system__plan-sub {
      margin-left: 0 !important;
      border-left: none !important;
      padding-left: 0 !important;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .system { padding: 100px 0; }
    .system__campaign {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .system__card-content {
      padding: 40px 24px;
    }
    .system__visitor { padding: 24px; }
  }
</style>
